# Shared documents

These files are symlinks into OLLMchat. Read them. Do not edit them. A write here changes the other project.

- `docs/coding-standards.md`
- `docs/coding-standards-router.md`
- `docs/code-documentation.md`
- `docs/guide-to-writing-plans.md`
- `docs/bug-fix-process.md`

Argus-only rules stay in this repo. A cursor rule, or a file under `docs/` that is not one of those links.

```
# Wrong. This path is the OLLMchat file.
docs/coding-standards-router.md

# Right. A rule that belongs to Argus.
.cursor/rules/rpc-commands.mdc
```
